r it."}],"url":"\/documentation\/implicitgraphs\/implicitdirectedgraph\/successors","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Successors"}]},"doc://ImplicitGraphs/documentation/ImplicitGraphs/ImplicitDirectedGraph/Successors/map(_:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ImplicitGraphs\/documentation\/ImplicitGraphs\/ImplicitDirectedGraph\/Successors\/map(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/implicitgraphs\/implicitdirectedgraph\/successors\/map(_:)","title":"map(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"map","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">((","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://ImplicitGraphs/documentation/ImplicitGraphs":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/ImplicitGraphs\/documentation\/ImplicitGraphs","type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/implicitgraphs","title":"ImplicitGraphs","kind":"symbol"},"doc://ImplicitGraphs/documentation/ImplicitGraphs/ImplicitDirectedGraph":{"url":"\/documentation\/implicitgraphs\/implicitdirectedgraph","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A finite directed graph on the vertices "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0..<vertexCount"},{"type":"text","text":" whose out-neighbors come from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closure,